## Which processor to pick (final call)

* **ESP32-S3 (recommended):** does everything here (ADC for AD8318, SPI for ADF4351 & 5.8-VRX, I²C for OLED/gauge, PWM for buzzer). Cold-start to scanning in ~100 ms. Battery-friendly.
* **STM32H7 (alt):** best if your team prefers STM32 peripherals/timers. More code ceremony, similar capability.
* **Raspberry Pi (not recommended)** unless you explicitly want HDMI UI/recording/ML add-ons. Otherwise it’s extra bulk, power, and boot delay for zero gain in analog demod.

